{{Wireless embedded system |brand=Planet |model=WNRT-617 |revision=v1 |asin= |manuf_country=China |manuf=TP-LINK |manuf_model=TL-WR741ND |manuf_rev=v2 |availability=EoL |fcc_date=06/13/2011 |fcc_id=UL9WNRT617V1, TE7WR741NDV2 |pcb_id=2050500144 |type=wireless router |pwr_v=9 |pwr_amp=0.6 |pwr_conn=barrel |cpu1_brand=Atheros |cpu1_model=AR7240 |cpu1_cspeed=400 |fla1=4 |fla1_brand=Eon |fla1_model=EN25Q32B |ram1=32 |ram1_brand=Zentel |ram1_model=A3S56D40FTP-G5 |expansion_if_types= |expansion_usb_num= |jtag= |serial= |wi1_chip1_brand=Atheros |wi1_chip1_model=AR9285 |wi1_802dot11_protocols=bgn |wi1_ant_conn= |wi1_txchains=1 |wi1_rxchains=1 |wi1_sstreams=1 |eth_cpu=true |sw_cpu=true |sw_brand= |sw_model= |lan_speed=100M |lan_ports=4 |wan_speed=100M |wan_ports=1 |flags= |tp_firmware= |802dot11_protocols=bgn |default_ssid= |default_ssid_regex= |default_ip=192.168.1.1 |default_user=admin |default_pass=admin |oui= |oui_eth= }} {{TagLine|150Mbps 802.11n Wireless Broadband Router}}
"2050500144" and "Rev:1.1" is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos. :This is the same text found on the [[ALFA Network AIP-W411 v2.1.0]] :and [[SMC SMCWBR14S-N5 rev A1]]'s boards.
The power adapter shown in the FCC photos is a ''VASATA'' P090060-2C1 :(100-240VAC ~50/60Hz, 0.3A -> 9VDC, 0.6A).
